{"claims":[{"claim_text":"Americans expressed a need for compassion, empathy, a commitment to values, and unity in local platform hearings around the country and the world.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"Americans expressed similar themes in town halls in Nevada, policy roundtables in Philadelphia, and online gatherings held by Democrats Abroad.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"Barack Obama's message emphasizes that Americans are connected to each other alongside their individualism.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"Focusing solely on individual concerns and separating individual stories from the larger story of America is not representative of American identity.", "claim_types":["characterization"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"A child in Chicago who cannot read affects all Americans.", "claim_types":["characterization"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"A senior citizen in Elko, Nevada who must choose between medicine and rent diminishes the lives of all Americans.", "claim_types":["characterization"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"Joining together in something larger than oneself is necessary to write the next chapter in America's story.", "claim_types":["evaluation"],"evidence_ids":[1]}],"unresolved_references":[]}
```

